# Version 1.15's rounds, round 5 of 5, on a fresh sample of the agents (seed 35): voice alone with two, four and six
# callers, for each count's SLO, and the configuration to deploy at the serving profile's step cap of 256 against the
# same with the program's optimizations (the opt-*-ret arms), paired: beside 24 agent sessions of the discriminating
# scenario with 2, 4 and 6 callers, and beside 16 agent sessions of the whole corpus. The rounds alternate the nodes
# (odd rounds Phastform, even ones Gray), and each runs its engine groups in an order rotated from the round before.
#   FLATSHARE_GPU=NODE benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh --pause benchmarks/e2/opt-r5.campaign

agents-seed 35

# engine make-room (48-token window) --max-num-batched-tokens 256 --long-prefill-token-threshold 0
arms/sweep-disc-pr-ab48-b256-t0-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-b256-c4-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-b256-c6-s24.toml
arms/opt-std-b256-s16.toml

# engine make-room, the same with the program's optimizations
arms/opt-disc-ret-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-ret-c4-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-ret-c6-s24.toml
arms/opt-std-ret-s16.toml

# engine frozen (voice alone)
arms/w5-a1-voice.toml
arms/w5-a1-voice-c4.toml
arms/w5-a1-voice-c6.toml
